<title>BELGIUM: EU probes Siemens buy of Elektrowatt.</title>
<headline>EU probes Siemens buy of Elektrowatt.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Tuesday it would start a second-phase four-month investigation of Siemens's planned buy of Elektrowatt.</p>
<p>&quot;The main concerns of the Commission are the high market shares of he parties for electricity meters, highly concentrated markets even before the merger, and for payphones in Germany,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
<p>Siemens's planned purchase of all of the industrial activities of Swiss energy and industrial firm Elektrowatt AG of Zurich was notified to the European Union executive on June 24 under the EU's merger regulation.</p>
</text>
